## 1. Architecture & Tech Stack

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Client[Web Frontend / Mobile / Postman] -->|HTTP / REST + Bearer JWT| FastAPI[FastAPI Application App]
    FastAPI --> SlowAPI[SlowAPI Rate Limiter]
    FastAPI --> Logging[Request Logging Middleware]
    FastAPI --> AuthGuard[RBAC / JWT Authentication Guard]
    
    subgraph Services Layer
        AuthGuard --> AuthSvc[Auth & User Service]
        AuthGuard --> CourseSvc[Course & Curriculum Service]
        AuthGuard --> BatchSvc[Batch & Enrollment Service]
        AuthGuard --> ContentSvc[Lecture & Material Service]
        AuthGuard --> AssessmentSvc[Assignment & Quiz Service]
        AuthGuard --> AttendanceSvc[Attendance & Audit Service]
        AuthGuard --> ProgressSvc[Progress & Completion Engine]
        AuthGuard --> CertSvc[Certificate & Verification Service]
        AuthGuard --> PaymentSvc[Fee Payment & Invoicing Service]
        AuthGuard --> ReportSvc[Export & Dashboard Service]
    end

    Services Layer --> Storage[Local File Storage / S3 Adapter]
    Services Layer --> PDFGen[ReportLab PDF Engine]
    Services Layer --> ExcelGen[OpenPyXL Workbook Engine]
    Services Layer --> SQLAlchemy[SQLAlchemy 2.0 ORM + Alembic]
    SQLAlchemy --> MySQL[(MySQL 8.4 InnoDB Database)]
```

- **Runtime**: Python 3.12
- **Web Framework**: FastAPI 0.115+
- **Database**: MySQL 8.4 Community Server (`utf8mb4_unicode_ci`)
- **ORM & Migrations**: SQLAlchemy 2.0 + Alembic
- **Security & Tokens**: Argon2id (`argon2-cffi`) + PyJWT (HS256)
- **Document Generation**: ReportLab (High-resolution certificates & receipts) + OpenPyXL (Excel exports)

